===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr}} {{term|vis||screw, winding stairs|lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|fro}} {{term|vis|lang=fro}}, {{term|viz|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|vitis||vine|lang=la}}; probably akin to English {{term|withy}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{US}} An [[instrument]] consisting of two [[jaw]]s, closing by a screw, [[lever]], [[cam]], or the like, for holding work, as in filing.

